<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-NCC returns to profit in H1 '97.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NCC returns to profit in H1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company NCC on Monday posted its results for the six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Result after fin items	 PROFIT	82 vs     82 LOSS</p>
<p> Construction orders			14,783 vs 13,896</p>
<p> Swedish orders				9,138 vs 10,539</p>
<p> Net sales				    11,938 vs  9,570</p>
<p> Operating costs			    10,915 vs  8,584</p>
<p> Selling and admin costs		     953 vs    811</p>
<p> Associate interests		     LOSS 73 vs     55 LOSS</p>
<p> Capital gains				   105 vs	5</p>
<p> Gain/loss of property sales	  GAIN 196 vs     11 LOSS</p>
<p> Operating income				298 vs    114</p>
<p> Tax					 CHARGE 17 vs	3 CREDIT</p>
<p> Minorities					  1 vs	3</p>
<p> Net result			     PROFIT  64 vs     82 LOSS</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
